cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pyfixest in your research, please cite it as below,
  and consider citing fixest (Bergé, Butts & McDermott, 2026), whose API
  design and behavioral conventions pyfixest adapts for Python.
title: "PyFixest: Fast high-dimensional fixed-effects regression in Python"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fischer
    given-names: Alexander
    affiliation: trivago N.V.
  - family-names: Stimpfle
    given-names: Leonard
    affiliation: Ghent University
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7033-7010"
  - family-names: Schröder
